@@ -13,48 +13,6 @@ open PottsDiscontinuity.FK PottsDiscontinuity.FK.Medial
 
 noncomputable section
 
-/-- The normalized bond underlying a genuine induced-rectangle edge has its
-actual endpoints in the rectangle. -/
